---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import injuryImage from '../assets/images/personal-injury.avif'; // Using personal-injury.avif
---

<BaseLayout title="Personal Injury Attorneys | Hanover and Echols">
  <Header />

  <main class="bg-[#02084b] text-white pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      
      <!-- HERO SECTION: Image left, Headings right -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-8 mb-16">
        <img 
          src={injuryImage.src} 
          alt="Personal Injury Legal Services" 
          class="w-150 h-auto rounded-lg shadow-xl" 
        />
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif mb-2 text-[#00E5FF]">Personal Injury</h1>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-slate-300">Dedicated Advocacy for Your Recovery and Rights</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CONTENT SECTION -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
        <!-- Paragraph 1: 10 lines -->
        <p>Experiencing a personal injury due to the negligence of another party can be an life-altering event that leaves you grappling with significant physical, emotional, and financial burdens. When you are thrust into the aftermath of a serious accident, the focus should be entirely on your recovery and healing rather than managing the complexities of insurance claims and legal obstacles. Our firm stands as a dedicated partner for individuals navigating these challenging times, providing aggressive representation aimed at securing the compensation you rightfully deserve. We understand that personal injury cases are not merely about legal technicalities; they are about restoring your quality of life and ensuring that those responsible are held fully accountable for their actions. From the moment you contact our offices, our team begins to meticulously build your case, gathering evidence and consulting with medical professionals to construct a narrative that highlights the full impact of your injuries on your daily existence and long-term future. We prioritize a client-first approach, ensuring that your story is heard and that your legal strategy is fully aligned with your personal recovery objectives, allowing you to move forward with the security and professional support you desperately need.</p>
        
        <!-- Paragraph 2: 8 lines -->
        <p>Successfully navigating a personal injury claim requires a deep understanding of liability laws and a relentless commitment to obtaining fair outcomes. Our legal team is adept at dismantling the defensive tactics often used by large insurance companies to minimize or deny valid claims. We do not accept low-ball settlement offers that fail to account for the true extent of your damages, and we prepare every case as if it will proceed directly to trial. By leveraging our deep experience and rigorous investigative methods, we ensure that every piece of evidence—from accident reports to expert testimony—is utilized to strengthen your position in negotiations. This proactive posture is designed to force opposing parties to recognize the strength of your case early, often leading to more favorable resolutions while reducing the time and stress associated with prolonged litigation processes. Your financial recovery is our priority, and we work tirelessly to ensure no detail is overlooked in our pursuit of justice.</p>

        <!-- 5 Bullets referring to Paragraph 2 -->
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li>Strategic handling of insurance negotiations to maximize your total recovery amount.</li>
          <li>Thorough investigation of all liability factors to ensure a strong and defensible case.</li>
          <li>Utilization of expert testimony to establish clear documentation of all your injuries.</li>
          <li>Refusal of inadequate settlement offers that do not address your comprehensive needs.</li>
          <li>Full litigation preparation to provide maximum leverage throughout the entire claim process.</li>
        </ul>

        <!-- Paragraph 3: 10 lines -->
        <p>Beyond the legal and financial aspects of your claim, we recognize that the recovery journey is deeply personal and multifaceted. Our attorneys are trained to treat each client with the dignity and respect they deserve, providing clear, transparent, and frequent updates that keep you fully informed at every juncture. We are acutely aware that medical costs can accumulate rapidly, and we strive to mitigate that stress by handling all communications with providers and stakeholders on your behalf. Our commitment extends to helping you find the right resources for your physical recovery, ensuring that your path back to health is supported by the best available expertise. We believe that true legal advocacy involves listening to your specific concerns—whether they relate to lost wages, pain and suffering, or future medical requirements—and translating those needs into a powerful legal argument. By maintaining a focus on sustainable and complete outcomes, we help you secure the resources necessary to transition back to your normal life with confidence. Our team takes pride in being the bridge between the trauma you have suffered and the future you deserve, providing the legal stability that allows you to concentrate purely on your physical and emotional well-being throughout this difficult chapter.</p>
        
        <!-- Paragraph 4: (Length as per requirement) -->
        <p>Our firm is deeply committed to serving the community, and we treat every client with the same level of intensity and dedication regardless of the complexity of their specific accident. We invite you to contact us to discuss the details of your situation in a private, confidential setting where your questions will be addressed with empathy and clarity. With our support, you do not have to confront this legal battle alone, and we are ready to stand as your strongest advocates against those who have caused you harm. Let us handle the burden of the legal process so that you can reclaim your focus, your health, and your future. We invite you to look at our resources including personal-injury-one.jpg to better understand our dedication to excellence.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- CALL TO ACTION -->
      <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
        <a 
          href="/contact-us" 
          class="flex-1 py-5 px-8 rounded-xl bg-[#00E5FF] text-[#010636] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-widest shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,229,255,0.3)] hover:bg-[#00E5FF]/80 transition-all"
        >
          Request a Free Case Review
        </a>
        <a 
          href="tel:+14699024621" 
          class="flex-1 py-5 px-8 rounded-xl bg-[#FDD835] text-[#010636] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl hover:bg-[#FDD835]/80 transition-all"
        >
          Call Us Today – +1 469 902 4621
        </a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>